      "titleZh": "第 7 段",
      "titleEn": "Part 7",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "It feels nice to be hired.",
          "tc": "被錄取的感覺很好。",
          "englishTokens": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It feels nice to be "
            },
            {
              "type": "word",
              "text": "hired",
              "targetId": "word-hire",
              "instanceId": "marker-b1-ch5-job-interview-essentials-slow-english-podcast-for-intermediate-b1-025-01"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "en": "For someone to say, \"You're hired,\" is nice.",
          "tc": "有人對你說：「你被錄取了，」感覺很好。",
          "englishTokens": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For someone to say, \"You're "
            },
            {
              "type": "word",
              "text": "hired",
              "targetId": "word-hire",
              "instanceId": "marker-b1-ch5-job-interview-essentials-slow-english-podcast-for-intermediate-b1-026-01"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ",\" is nice."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "en": "But just as it feels nice to be hired, it feels really bad to be fired.",
          "tc": "但是，就像被錄取感覺很好一樣，被解雇的感覺真的很糟。",
          "englishTokens": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "But just as it feels nice to be "
            },
            {
              "type": "word",
              "text": "hired",
              "targetId": "word-hire",
              "instanceId": "marker-b1-ch5-job-interview-essentials-slow-english-podcast-for-intermediate-b1-027-01"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", it feels really bad to be "
            },
            {
              "type": "word",
              "text": "fired",
              "targetId": "word-fire",
              "instanceId": "marker-b1-ch5-job-interview-essentials-slow-english-podcast-for-intermediate-b1-027-02"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "en": "I got fired one year ago, and it was awful.",
          "tc": "我一年前被解雇了，那很可怕。",
          "englishTokens": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I got "
            },
            {
              "type": "word",
              "text": "fired",
              "targetId": "word-fire",
              "instanceId": "marker-b1-ch5-job-interview-essentials-slow-english-podcast-for-intermediate-b1-028-01"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " one year ago, and it was awful."
            }
          ]
        }
